; Pripyat Full Novikov is a mechanic even though his spawn/animation is
; maintained separately. The inherited item whitelist contains every STCoP
; outfit and helmet but no weapon: weapons therefore keep the repair button
; while their upgrade tree remains hidden by can_upgrade_item().
[pf_bunker_novikov]:jup_b6_scientist_tech
; Separate Novikov-only profile: upgrades x2.5, linear repair coefficient 1.65.
; The existing 25% scientist-task discount applies to both values.
discount_condlist = {=counter_equal(jup_b1_sci_task_controller_count:4)} %=pf_novikov_price_profile(0.75)%, %=pf_novikov_price_profile(1.0)%
pf_guardian_seva_outfit

